Title: Pokebot3DS Bridge

Summary: Stock-Luma ORAS RAM/input bridge with live status overlay

Description: |
  Experimental Pokebot3DS-CFW bridge for Pokemon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire.
  Exposes UDP 4952 read-only RAM and acknowledged additive input without replacing Luma3DS.
  Includes an always-visible hardware-proof overlay for PC, RAM and simulated input state.
